\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {11}{\ignorespaces The methods of the second stage. The gate is $\beta = 0.5$ for every method (the members and the proxy values do not depend on $\beta $, so the gate is an evaluation choice); the fixed-TS duo is scored on the same runs. The reset at shift boundaries reuses the episodic runs (script 03); only the gate is rescored.}}{8}{}\protected@file@percent }
